# Nonante has no runtime secrets: all verb data is static and ships with the
# app; there is no backend state.
#
# The deploy workflow authenticates to Fly.io with the FLY_API_TOKEN GitHub
# Actions secret (mirrored from the 1Password "Eviebot" vault, item "nonante").
# That token is a CI credential — it is never injected into the app, so it has
# no entry here.
